- Three sources of one node: its `view.tree` declaration, its method and its rule.
- Port of `Source_type` of `$hyoo_studio`, down to the deck of three `$mol_textarea`.
-
- A node is a flat property of the class after normalization, so the three texts of
- a node are three slices of the three texts of the class: the declaration, the
- method of that name in the body, and the rule addressed to the attribute $mol
- writes on it. The whole class is one switch away, and that switch is the whole
- difference between the two modes.
- @see ../../ARCHITECTURE.md sections 1 and 2
$bog_vmap_app_code $mol_view
	- Class the three texts belong to: the root class of the document.
	klass \
	- Property name of the picked node, empty when nothing is picked. Without one
	- there is nothing to slice and the panel edits the class whole.
	prop \
	- Signature of the picked property: whether it takes a key and whether it takes
	- a next. Only the empty method of a node that has none yet is shaped by them.
	prop_key false
	prop_next false
	- `view.tree` of the whole document, two way.
	source? \
	- Declaration of the picked node, two way. The same value the inspector edits,
	- so a change made with the mouse shows up in the text without a path of its own.
	node_source? \
	- Handwritten body of the class, two way.
	js? \
	- Styles of the class, two way.
	css? \
	- What the scene said about this node last, empty when it said nothing.
	error \
	- Editing the class whole instead of the picked node.
	whole? false
	- Why the last edit was not written into the document, empty when it was.
	refusal? \
	sub <= content /$mol_view
	Head $mol_bar
		sub <= head_content /$mol_view
	- Which node the three texts belong to, in words.
	Scope_note $mol_view
		sub / <= scope_note \
	Scope $mol_check
		title \Весь класс
		hint \Править три текста класса целиком, а не только выбранный узел
		checked? <=> whole?
	- The failure the scene reported for this node. Here and not only in the status
	- strip: an error belongs where the code that caused it is being written.
	Alarm $mol_view
		sub / <= error
	- Why the last edit was not written into the document. The text stays in the
	- field so it can be fixed; the document keeps the last one that parsed.
	Refusal $mol_view
		sub / <= note \
	Sources $mol_deck
		items /
			<= Tree $mol_textarea
				title \view.tree
				hint \Имя_узла $mol_view
				sidebar_showed true
				value? <=> tree_text? \
			<= Js $mol_textarea
				title \JS
				hint \
				sidebar_showed true
				value? <=> js_text? \
			<= Css $mol_textarea
				title \CSS
				hint \
				sidebar_showed true
				value? <=> css_text? \
